The alias of each pref is also permitted so instead of having to type out 'secondaryPreferred' and getting the spelling wrong, we can simply pass 'sp'.

The read option also allows us to specify tag sets. These tell the 【90†driver†github.com】 from which members of the replica-set it should attempt to read. Read more about tag sets 【91†here†www.mongodb.com】 and 【92†here†www.mongodb.com】.

